140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (Tourists visiting Malaysia often face difficulties in discovering authentic local food experiences. Information about Malaysian cuisine is usually scattered across multiple platforms, focuses mainly on popular tourist areas, or lacks cultural context. As a result, travelers may miss out on traditional dishes and local food destinations that represent Malaysia's diverse food culture.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (This project aims to address this problem by creating a Local Food Tourism Guide website that centralizes information about Malaysian local food. The website provides clear categorization, visual content, and easy navigation to help users explore regional dishes, street food, and food markets. By offering a user-friendly and informative platform, the website enhances the travel experience and promotes local food as an important part of tourism.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
